ques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"PLebbMEYWV-5ggzx0c4lBQ","review_id":"Wi8k4csdqdkMMn3e6jS0tg","date":"2018-06-04T18:33:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9325451850891113,"text_excerpt":"Wings were amazing and so was the sauce Honey Heat !!! I didn't care for the fries but I still gave them a 5 because those wings were AMAZING! I look forward to trying them again! Service: 5 cashier was nice and pleasant Food: wings were big and meaty and fried to perfection! The fries were not my cup of tea but I wasn't there for the fries! Atmosphere: small and quaint maybe in cooler days I would eat inside and or outdoor."},{"business_id":"PLebbMEYWV-5ggzx0c4lBQ","review_id":"MGy0qzSVP7yQHmc0ySxfpg","date":"2018-06-30T02:37:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9290541410446167,"text_excerpt":"Man oh man lemme tell you.... these are the best wings I have ever had. My girl just wanted some wings so we went to the nearest one with the best reviews. Shop was nice with seating inside and outside. Wings didn't take too long too cook. They also let us try out the flavor that I wanted to try out. We got half Cajun half Buffalo with the side of fries and drinks (They have us an extra wing too). Wings was well well cooked. We didn't even have to ask them to cook them well done like other restaurants (ie. Wingstop, BBW, Pluckers, etc). Not too crispy but definitely not soft. The Cajun wings were amazing, I definitely recommend that everyone try that. Fantastic taste. I didn't even plan o..."},{"business_id":"PLebbMEYWV-5ggzx0c4lBQ","review_id":"U9rVQkVYZMHMMU_g-WLIpg","date":"2020-07-27T00:28:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9282922148704529,"text_excerpt":"Online ordering and pick up was super easy and the food was ready by the time we got there. The wings were really good and not too saucy! The flavors were distinct. I especially enjoyed the sriracha lemon pepper wings. The fries aren't my favorite in the city but they were fine. We didn't eat there but they had a cute outdoor area (I believe the chairs were tilted because of the summer rain that day) I want to come back to try more flavors!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"PLebbMEYWV-5ggzx0c4lBQ","photo_id":"7RMnXryTlq7umwJ-vkfNZA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7RMnXryTlq7umwJ-vkfNZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.873413622379303},{"business_id":"PLebbMEYWV-5ggzx0c4lBQ","photo_id":"lNjk8tNiNKRw_VtRaCbkUg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/lNjk8tNiNKRw_VtRaCbkUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8659969568252563},{"business_id":"PLebbMEYWV-5ggzx0c4lBQ","photo_id":"ArMl_Iqa_nb_3s-kWBSlOA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ArMl_Iqa_nb_3s-kWBSlOA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8589092493057251},{"business_id":"PLebbMEYWV-5ggzx0c4lBQ","photo_id":"2jkV6mtcJpNOXPgwp7OPkQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/2jkV6mtcJpNOXPgwp7OPkQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8356485366821289},{"business_id":"PLebbMEYWV-5ggzx0c4lBQ","photo_id":"9g3u15rrHlK2V-MRtttpTQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/9g3u15rrHlK2V-MRtttpTQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.789604902267456}]},"notebook_case":null}
